{"id": "unknown-2026-08-05-003", "date": "2026-08-05", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 32, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Bangladesh, S Korea sign Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement", "content": "Bangladesh and South Korea have signed a trade agreement that will grant preferential tariff treatment to 97 per cent of goods from the former entering the latter. \nThe pact allows Bangladesh to extend preferential market access to 87 per cent of South Korean products. \nKorean investment would be encouraged in high-value sectors like semiconductors, IT, shipbuilding, ship recycling and light engineering. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/bangladesh-s-korea-sign-comprehensive-economic-partnership-agreement-312375-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "lenzing-2026-08-05-004", "date": "2026-08-05", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 32, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": ["lenzing"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["growth", "improve"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Austria’s Lenzing doubles H1 2026 profit despite lower revenue", "content": "Lenzing has reported a stronger H1 2026 despite lower revenue, with net profit more than doubling to €35.6 million (~$40.9 million) as higher-margin product sales, cost reductions and favourable foreign exchange effects improved earnings.\nThe company is accelerating its 'Grow Nonwovens, Reset Textiles' strategy, targeting premium fibres, additional cost savings and medium-term EBITDA growth.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/austria-s-lenzing-doubles-h1-2026-profit-despite-lower-revenue-312374-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-05-005", "date": "2026-08-05", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 32, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cotton_price", "order_visibility", "supply_chain_shift", "earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["weak"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "ICE cotton retreats on profit booking, weaker crude oil", "content": "ICE cotton futures edged lower as profit-booking followed a strong rally that had lifted prices to a two-month high.\nWeaker crude oil prices also weighed on sentiment.\nHowever, tightening ICE certified stocks, hot and dry weather in the US, below-average monsoon forecasts in India, and expected lower output in Brazil continued to underpin the market, keeping the broader trend bullish.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/ice-cotton-retreats-on-profit-booking-weaker-crude-oil-312373-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-05-006", "date": "2026-08-05", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 32, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India opens handloom technology centre at IIT Delhi", "content": "India has opened a Centre of Excellence for Handloom Technology at IIT Delhi to link handloom heritage with research, digital tools and sustainability.\nFive initiatives span productivity monitoring, e-learning, startup incubation, Gen Z design and recycled defence textiles.\nThe centre will research loom modernisation, AI and ergonomics, and train at least 1,000 weavers and professionals over", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-opens-handloom-technology-centre-at-iit-delhi-312364-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-05-007", "date": "2026-08-05", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 32, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Guangdong, Zhejiang, Jiangsu: Inside China's three-way textile rivalry", "content": "China's textile and apparel exports totalled $293.77 billion in 2025, with Guangdong, Zhejiang and Jiangsu accounting for 70–80 per cent of output.\nZhejiang leads by revenue and export value, built on synthetic fibre, fabric trading, Yiwu distribution and digital/smart factories.\nJiangsu's vertical chain and Guangdong's finished-garment base show competition shifting from cost to capability.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_apparel", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/apparel-news/guangdong-zhejiang-jiangsu-inside-china-s-three-way-textile-rivalry-312371-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-05-008", "date": "2026-08-05", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 32, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Bangladesh’s BGMEA calls media reports of RMG units’ closure baseless", "content": "Bangladesh trade body BGMEA has dismissed claims by some media outlets that several garment factories, including those of the DBL Group, were shut down due to gas and power shortage.  \nTerming the information as ‘completely false and baseless’, it said despite gas and power shortage, BGMEA member factories have managed to keep their production activities operational with government support. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_apparel", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/apparel-news/bangladesh-s-bgmea-calls-media-reports-of-rmg-units-closure-baseless-312348-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
